      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Warren_City%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The city lies just 4 miles northeast of Gladewater’s center and 12 miles northwest of Longview, making it a quiet commuter hub.",
